  "notable_quotes": [
    "All metastable pore structures can convert to target ones under sufficiently high target-gas pressures, and the shaped pores remain after guest removal.",
    "Only a few flexible adsorbents have suitable energy barriers, and those reported examples show shape-memory behavior rather than true plastic-pore behavior.",
    "Plastic behavior is enabled by tuning ligand side-group hydrogen bonding and steric hindrance, which fine-tunes energy differences and barriers between metastable pore states."
  ],
